# 쿠폰 발급 → 주문(쿠폰 적용) 전체 시나리오 (위에서 아래로 순서대로 실행)
# 각 요청의 응답에서 생성된 ID를 전역 변수로 캡처해 다음 요청에 자동으로 넘긴다.
# 실행 전: docker-compose -f ./docker/infra-compose.yml up + commerce-api bootRun (localhost:8080)

@loginId = user0001
@loginPw = pw123456
@ldap = loopers.admin

### 0. 회원가입 (대고객)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "{{loginId}}",
  "password": "{{loginPw}}"
}

> {%
    client.test("회원가입 성공", () => client.assert(response.status === 200));
%}

### 1. [관리자] 브랜드 등록 → brandId 캡처
POST {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/brands
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "루퍼스",
  "description": "테스트 브랜드"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("brandId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 2. [관리자] 상품 등록 (재고 100) → productId 캡처
POST {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/products
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": {{brandId}},
  "name": "운동화",
  "description": "테스트 상품",
  "price": 1000,
  "stock": 100
}

> {%
    client.global.set("productId", response.body.data.id);
    client.test("재고 노출 확인", () => client.assert(response.body.data.stock === 100));
%}

### 3. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 등록 - 정률(RATE) → couponId 캡처
POST {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/coupons
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "신규가입 10% 할인",
  "type": "RATE",
  "value": 10,
  "minOrderAmount": 1000,
  "expiredAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("couponId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 4. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 등록 - 정액(FIXED)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/coupons
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "5백원 할인",
  "type": "FIXED",
  "value": 500,
  "minOrderAmount": null,
  "expiredAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### 5. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 목록 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/coupons?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}

### 6. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 상세 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/coupons/{{couponId}}
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}

### 7. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 수정
PUT {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/coupons/{{couponId}}
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "신규가입 15% 할인",
  "type": "RATE",
  "value": 15,
  "minOrderAmount": 1000,
  "expiredAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### 8. [사용자] 쿠폰 발급 요청 → memberCouponId 캡처
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/coupons/{{couponId}}/issue
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}

> {%
    client.global.set("memberCouponId", response.body.data.memberCouponId);
    client.test("발급 직후 상태 AVAILABLE", () =>
        client.assert(response.body.data.state === "AVAILABLE"));
%}

### 9. [사용자] 내 쿠폰 목록 조회 (AVAILABLE / USED / EXPIRED)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/users/me/coupons
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}

### 10. [사용자] 쿠폰 미적용 주문
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{productId}}, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.test("쿠폰 미적용 시 결제금액=총액", () =>
        client.assert(response.body.data.paymentAmount === response.body.data.totalAmount));
%}

### 11. [사용자] 쿠폰 적용 주문 (couponId = 발급받은 회원 쿠폰 ID)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{productId}}, "quantity": 3 }
  ],
  "couponId": {{memberCouponId}}
}

> {%
    client.test("할인이 적용되어 결제금액 < 총액", () =>
        client.assert(response.body.data.paymentAmount < response.body.data.totalAmount));
    client.test("적용된 쿠폰 ID 일치", () =>
        client.assert(response.body.data.appliedMemberCouponId !== null));
%}

### 12. [사용자] 사용된 쿠폰 재적용 시도 → 실패해야 함 (이미 USED, CONFLICT)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{loginId}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{loginPw}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": {{productId}}, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": {{memberCouponId}}
}

> {%
    client.test("이미 사용된 쿠폰은 주문 실패", () => client.assert(response.status === 409));
%}

### 13. [관리자] 특정 쿠폰의 발급 내역 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/coupons/{{couponId}}/issues?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: {{ldap}}
